# Coverage artefacts. .coverage was TRACKED (430KB binary) and matched no
# ignore rule, so it showed as dirty on every run and, because there is no
# [tool.hatch.build.targets.sdist] section, hatchling's VCS-aware default would
# have swept it into a published sdist: internal paths and line-hit data for a
# security tool.
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
coverage.xml
